  (text "SAO++ power select: the switch common feeds the LEDs. Position 1 = badge 3.3 V, position 2 = OFF (pin 2 unconnected), position 3 = coin cell." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9843a76e-0ed0-5b3b-8d67-28be8cc1082a"))
  (text "The badge supply and the coin cell sit on separate switch contacts and are never connected to each other." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 41.91 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3a14ecf7-03bf-52bc-ac5f-a2559e07c2d3"))
  (text "LED-only board: SDA, SCL, GPIO1 and GPIO2 are not connected, so no series diode is needed on the cell (see docs/standard.md section 3)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6b8c8d6b-c590-57a2-82c7-d6f37e772ac0"))
  (text "D1, D2 = eyes; D3 to D8 = teeth. One 1.3k resistor per white LED: about 0.4 mA each on badge power, about 0.2 mA each on a fresh cell." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 147.32 140.97 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8be37e70-be1a-57bb-810b-8ef9f0ed63b1"))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
